[00:13.58]1. God’s Word shines like a brilliant light,
[00:13.80]Guides our feet through earth’s dark night.
[00:18.02]If we follow it faithfully,
[00:20.24]Surely its truth will set us free.
[00:28.22]2. He provides us with words inspired,
[00:28.60]Helps us learn what is required.
[00:28.60]Holy writings can motivate,
[00:28.60]Show how to teach and set things straight.
[01:58.00]3. By these words from our God above,
[02:05.16]We have come to know his love.
[02:11.82]As we read in it ev’ry day,
[02:19.16]God’s Word will keep us on the way.
